  m_text: "Players traverse around the board trying to collect <color=yellow>@4000</color>
    through any means possible.\n\nThe means in question:\n <indent=5%> -Build stores
    and force players \n<indent=12%> to buy your items and get <color=yellow>@</color>!</indent>\n\n<indent=5%>
    -Collect stamps around the board \n<indent=12%>and cash them at the Pawn Shop
    for <color=yellow>@</color>!\n<indent=12%><color=grey>More stamps at once = Big
    @!!!</color>\n\n<indent=5%> -Defeat players in combat \n<indent=12%>and steal
    their <color=yellow>@</color>! \n\n <indent=5%> -Get items from defeating monsters
    \n<indent=12%>in combat. Be sure to check what you got after!\n\n\n\n"
